211
00:16:43,795 --> 00:16:44,879
Homeostática.

212
00:16:45,630 --> 00:16:46,965
Como respirar.

213
00:16:48,383 --> 00:16:49,426
O sea…

214
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,805
- No. No.
- [ríe]

215
00:16:53,888 --> 00:16:56,349
Todavía hay mucho que no hemos entendido.

216
